WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,640
This guy can't really be illiterate, right?

2
00:00:02,800 --> 00:00:03,920
I also know this secret

3
00:00:04,080 --> 00:00:05,520
You won't silence me too, will you?

4
00:00:05,680 --> 00:00:06,840
Not so much

5
00:00:10,360 --> 00:00:12,040
The sect's big pen is opened

6
00:00:12,240 --> 00:00:15,320
I plan to send Chen Ji and Lin Lantian to compete

7
00:00:16,210 --> 00:00:17,810
Lin Lantian is fine

8
00:00:17,970 --> 00:00:21,610
After condensing the sword's heart, the strength becomes stronger, but

9
00:00:21,890 --> 00:00:23,290
Chen Ji is a demon cultivator

10
00:00:23,450 --> 00:00:25,570
Is it okay to participate in the big draw?

11
00:00:25,570 --> 00:00:26,930
He belongs to the reverse cultivation method

12
00:00:27,010 --> 00:00:28,370
It’s not about practicing magic skills

13
00:00:28,570 --> 00:00:30,410
Besides, he entered Taoism at such a young age.

14
00:00:30,570 --> 00:00:32,810
Taoist heart is much stronger than sword heart

15
00:00:33,210 --> 00:00:35,090
I feel more at ease with him here

16
00:00:36,980 --> 00:00:38,740
You are the one in charge who plans everything

17
00:00:38,900 --> 00:00:39,980
If the ancestor is here

18
00:00:40,180 --> 00:00:44,400
I will definitely arrange for him to be in charge.

19
00:00:44,560 --> 00:00:45,920
It’s not good for Da Shang to grow old

20
00:00:46,080 --> 00:00:47,600
Why is it bad again?

21
00:00:47,880 --> 00:00:49,720
How is this sect doing lately?

22
00:00:50,280 --> 00:00:51,560
Really bad

23
00:00:51,720 --> 00:00:56,640
The Holy Son is chasing Lin Lantian all over the sect. What is the reason for the pursuit?

24
00:00:56,760 --> 00:00:58,160
I definitely can't talk about illiteracy.

25
00:00:58,320 --> 00:01:00,400
This guy is too strong, if he knew it

26
00:01:00,560 --> 00:01:01,600
I will die too
